WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
It can actually be a very smart move for financially confident people.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.800
And there are different ways to borrow money.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.600
You can borrow from a friend or family member if you're comfortable with that.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.800
Many people also borrow from a bank, lines of credit, a credit card, a car loan, or a mortgage for a house.

5
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.800
There's also some loans available from the government like student loans.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.600
Borrowing money can help you achieve financial and life goals.

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
But it's important to borrow wisely, manage your debt well and limit your borrowing to what you can afford.

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.800
You know your own financial situation best.

9
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.800
So set your own debt limits.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.400
Don't let others set them for you.
